{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F9d5L4zAGLXiQGgWvN4bsz","type":"tool_result","content":"# Privacy policy\n\nPage type: legal\n\nPrivacy policy for Larkspur Supply Co.. Last updated 1 September 2026.\n\nTable of contents linking to each section below.\n\nSections:\n1. What we collect: your name, email, and address when you join; what you buy, so we can calculate your dividend; and rental records.\n2. How we use it: to run your membership, process orders and rentals, and send the newsletter if you ask for it.\n3. Who we share it with: our payment processor and our shipping carrier, only as needed. We never sell personal data.\n4. How long we keep it: purchase records for seven years, as tax law requires; everything else until you ask us to delete it.\n5. Your rights: you can ask for a copy of your data, a correction, or deletion. Email privacy@larkspur.coop.\n6. Cookies: we use one cookie to keep you signed in, and no tracking cookies.\nbrief.md\ncustom-elements\nforms\npatterns\nxhtml-author","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"20c984c7-abfc-455a-9ec1-86bacd90fbbb","uuid":"b99f4966-4a03-42cb-9bc8-dadd01856a75","timestamp":"2026-10-18T13:22:03.564Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Privacy policy\n\nPage type: legal\n\nPrivacy policy for Larkspur Supply Co.. Last updated 1 September 2026.\n\nTable of contents linking to each section below.\n\nSections:\n1. What we collect: your name, email, and address when you join; what you buy, so we can calculate your dividend; and rental records.\n2. How we use it: to run your membership, process orders and rentals, and send the newsletter if you ask for it.\n3. Who we share it with: our payment processor and our shipping carrier, only as needed. We never sell personal data.\n4. How long we keep it: purchase records for seven years, as tax law requires; everything else until you ask us to delete it.\n5. Your rights: you can ask for a copy of your data, a correction,